      en: ["The Highveld is located in the west of the country.", "Average elevation is between 1,000 and 1,400 meters.", "It is the wettest region in Eswatini.", "The Ngwenya Mine, the world's oldest mine, is located here.", "Temperatures are significantly cooler than in the Lowveld.", "Forestry is a major economic sector in this area."],
      es: ["Longitud: 100 km", "Diferencia de altura: hasta 500 m", "Roca: cuarcita, basalto", "Número de cascadas: más de 20", "Plantas endémicas: al menos 50", "Ancho de la escarpadura: 2-5 km"],
      pt: ["Comprimento: 100 km", "Diferença de altura: até 500 m", "Rocha: quartzito, basalto", "Número de cascatas: mais de 20", "Plantas endémicas: pelo menos 50", "Largura da escarpa: 2-5 km"],
